{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-6","kind":"proposition","title":"在给定圆内作内接正方形","englishTitle":"In a given circle to inscribe a square.","book":4,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","contentId":"euclid-4-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbecbe7628cf2f0422243946729f0555058eaed3844568a4f424847272f5894d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-6.statement","euclid-4-6.construction.1","euclid-4-6.construction.2","euclid-4-6.proof.1","euclid-4-6.proof.2","euclid-4-6.proof.3","euclid-4-6.proof.4","euclid-4-6.proof.5","euclid-4-6.proof.6","euclid-4-6.conclusion","euclid-4-6.historical.1","euclid-4-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa03096b4cfbefe28d93d7bbc6d64f77bdb526ecc10632b4d5747539d220b24b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a given circle to inscribe a square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个特定的圆圈里登记正方形"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作内切圜直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有圆求作内切圆正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"564014f67864e4e65d9afb10675e42bfeb9c81daf9006a39cb91f8034f8c2f37","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be the given circle; thus it is required to inscribe a square in the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD成为给定的圆;因此,需要在ABCD圆中加入正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e533b46eabf8f1ee36645e497d168f93da83f7f4b1d5656d831c07f404603c0b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two diameters AC, BD of the circle ABCD be drawn at right angles to one another, and let AB, BC, CD, DA be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABCD圆的直径为AC,BD,在直角时相互绘制,AB,BC,CD,DA连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"400d0ce0f4214bb0c8aa6d0a9289404624e81a6e9a8f9bfb38285cbc9af94e29","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since BE is equal to ED, for E is the centre, and EA is common and at right angles, therefore the base AB is equal to the base AD. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BE等于ED,E是中心,EA是普通的,直角时,底边 AB等于底边 AD。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88171a6df4c83ebf88ed6582ddee91b8453626031cc9832b500a752bfea7b3ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the straight lines BC, CD is also equal to each of the straight lines AB, AD; therefore the quadrilateral ABCD is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,BC直线中的每一条直线,CD也等于AB直线,AD直线,因此,四边ABCD是等边线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d7d29c3f46132f8bb598bf7d4787233be7cb001fd3792c395cb3f6f4872e4fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also right-angled."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是个正经问题。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f16e052b2f9c03bbde68210776975340d095bce3e13535c93c57eef9ebaa4474","citations":["euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the straight line BD is a diameter of the circle ABCD, therefore BAD is a semicircle; therefore the angle BAD is right. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于直线BD是圆的直径ABCD,因此BAD是半圆形;因此,角度BAD是正确的。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85a4a473ac97ef96ea431e94e22040da1caa6f26a4fbf8a2b18577214fb980e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the angles ABC, BCD, CDA is also right; therefore the quadrilateral ABCD is right-angled."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,每个角度ABC,BCD,CDA也是对的;因此,四边ABCD是右方的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24dc8b105e9ae7f2d5b3fc2ba94610645ef3a133f98e13644e4e540fcd0ffd61","citations":["euclid-1-def-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved equilateral; therefore it is a square; [[I. Def. 22](/principles/euclid-1-def-22)] and it has been inscribed in the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,它也是等边的,因此是正方形;它已被刻在ABCD圆。 [[I. Def. 22](/principles/euclid-1-def-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c927f4fbaa02b3030e024e28ba44a630969aa196d9d05f3a7700556a40a38db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the given circle the square ABCD has been inscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的圆圈内,已登记正方形 ABCD,即Q. E F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"424bfa89c4e2f695801e5cf2535871fdd963de09876ae2c57f919bf9acdd8720","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作内切圜直角方形法曰甲乙丙丁圜其心戊求作内切圜直角方形先作甲丙乙丁两径线以直角相交于戊次作甲乙乙丙丙丁丁甲四线即甲乙丙丁为内切圜直角方形论曰甲乙戊角形之甲戊与乙戊丙角形之戊丙两腰等乙戊同腰而腰间角两为直角即其底甲乙乙丙等〈一卷四〉依显乙丙丙丁亦等则四边形之四边俱等而甲乙丙丁四角皆在半圜分之上又皆直角〈三卷〉〈卅一〉是为内切圜直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有圆求作内切圆正方形作图方法如下：甲乙丙丁圆其心戊求作内切圆正方形先作甲丙乙丁两径线以直角相交于戊次作甲乙乙丙丙丁丁甲四线即甲乙丙丁为内切圆正方形证明如下：甲乙戊三角形之甲戊与乙戊丙三角形之戊丙两腰等乙戊同腰而腰间角两为直角即其底甲乙乙丙等〈一卷四〉依显乙丙丙丁亦等则四边形之四边都等而甲乙丙丁四角皆在半圆弧之上又皆直角〈三卷〉〈卅一〉是为内切圆正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-6.source","contentId":"euclid-4-6","revisionId":"euclid-4-6@raw-dbecbe7628cf2f04","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94ab4c7a44f186270d24ea53303d84d429e331d8be929a0bcdb7bf38834e1545","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-6:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-6.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.6/","sourceLa